#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:1
#: 66eaa239d7ba415ba5eac2bd61e0c0b7
msgid "最大误差结构：先复核，再决定删不删"
msgstr "Largest-Error Structures: Inspect Before Deleting"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:3
#: 38228d50343741d4a438088c89380945
#
msgid ""
"`查找最大误差点` 用来快速定位当前图上误差最大的结构。高误差不等于坏数据：它也可能表示训练集缺少这一类结构。正确顺序是先选中、看结构和 "
"`Config_type`，再决定重新计算、保留补强或删除。"
msgstr ""
"`Find Max Error Point` quickly locates the structures with the largest "
"errors on the current plot. A large error does not necessarily mean bad "
"data; it may show that the training set lacks this type of structure. "
"Select the points, inspect the structures and `Config_type`, then decide "
"whether to recalculate, retain and reinforce, or delete them."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:5
#: da2cc235b8c34788b224b0a07667fb0e
msgid "1. 先激活要检查的图"
msgstr "1. Activate the plot you want to inspect"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:7
#: c21263af6b824735b75483dfb4693128
msgid "打开训练结果后，双击要检查的小图，使它进入主图区。本例检查 `energy`；如果要找力误差最大的结构，应先激活 `force` 图。"
msgstr ""
"After opening the training results, double-click the thumbnail you want "
"to inspect so it enters the main plot. This example checks `energy`; to "
"find the structures with the largest force errors, activate the `force` "
"plot first."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:9
#: 310444fd6cb34cce9a022cae2520d1b6
msgid "激活能量图并打开最大误差筛选"
msgstr "Activate the energy plot and open the largest-error selector"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:9
#: 310444fd6cb34cce9a022cae2520d1b6
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_entry.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_entry.png"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:14
#: cdb0940ae1a14905a35a60a7a78a77b4
#
msgid "点击 `查找最大误差点`。这个按钮只针对当前主图，不会同时混合 energy、force、stress 和 virial 的误差。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Find Max Error Point`. This action applies only to the current "
"main plot; it does not combine errors from energy, force, stress, and "
"virial."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:16
#: f389f40d3709415593d02d23dc9b6c52
msgid "2. 输入要复核的结构数"
msgstr "2. Enter the number of structures to review"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:18
#: 7288d9c6a978441596f78d6d277ceba9
msgid "最大误差结构数量设置"
msgstr "Number of largest-error structures to select"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:18
#: 7288d9c6a978441596f78d6d277ceba9
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_maxerr_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_maxerr_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:23
#: c4213d9e6ef4417ba53edc805823a7f4
msgid "第一次可以先填 `5`。数量太大时容易失去重点；先看最极端的几个，确认问题类型后再扩大范围。"
msgstr ""
"Start with `5`. A large selection makes it harder to focus. Review the "
"most extreme cases first, identify the problem type, and then expand the "
"selection if needed."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:25
#: 46a95257afd74f8698f4583a6ea7c112
msgid "3. 逐个判断误差来源"
msgstr "3. Determine the source of each error"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:27
#: 551bc1befccc49cd8b372767b90d6a93
msgid "选中的五个最大能量误差结构"
msgstr "Five selected structures with the largest energy errors"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:27
#: 551bc1befccc49cd8b372767b90d6a93
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_result.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:32
#: 33820545919b4aae940a1faf131813f7
msgid "本例底部状态栏显示 `Sel: 5`。依次点击选中点，重点看右侧结构、`Config_type` 和原始文件序号："
msgstr ""
"The status bar in this example shows `Sel: 5`. Click the selected points "
"one by one and inspect the structure on the right, its `Config_type`, and"
" its source-file index:"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:34
#: 8a156d562c484eeaaa5fabb488af7782
msgid "结构合理、标签可信：通常应保留，并检查这一类构型是否在训练集中覆盖不足；"
msgstr ""
"Reasonable structure and trustworthy label: usually retain it and check "
"whether this configuration type is underrepresented in the training set."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:35
#: c9eb359ee4ee4e47ad89746ce91a418b
msgid "结构合理但 DFT 未收敛或标签异常：回到原计算重新检查，不要直接拿去重训；"
msgstr ""
"Reasonable structure but unconverged DFT or an abnormal label: return to "
"the original calculation and inspect it; do not use it directly for "
"retraining."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:36
#: 7cd0846add034c6eb0f7547c8901afe5
#
msgid "结构明显破坏、原子重叠或来源错误：确认后再删除，或者先 `导出已选择结构` 单独留档。"
msgstr "Clearly broken structure, overlapping atoms, or incorrect provenance: delete it only after confirmation, or use `Export Selected` to archive it separately first."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:38
#: d199c47302b94186a5132e3ecad747ce
msgid "不要把“删除最大误差点”当成降低 RMSE 的固定步骤。未经复核地删除，可能正好删掉模型最需要补学的区域。"
msgstr ""
"Do not treat deleting the largest-error points as a routine way to reduce"
" RMSE. Deleting them without review may remove exactly the region the "
"model most needs to learn."
